\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Christ is the foundation
\par Of the house we raise;
\par Be its walls salvation,
\par And its gateways praise:
\par May its threshold lowly
\par To the Lord be dear;
\par May the hearts be holy
\par That shall worship here.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Here the vow be sealed
\par By Thy Spirit, Lord;
\par Here the sick be healed,
\par And the lost restored;
\par Here the broken- hearted
\par Thy forgiveness prove;
\par Here the friends long parted
\par Be restored to love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Here may every token
\par Of Thy presence be;
\par Here may chains be broken,
\par Prisoners here set free;
\par Here may light illumine
\par Every soul of Thine,
\par Lifting up the human
\par Into the divine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Here may God the Father,
\par Christ the Saviour- Son,
\par With the Holy Spirit,
\par Be adored as One;
\par Till the whole creation
\par At Thy  footstool fall,
\par And in creation
\par Own Thee Lord of all.
\par                       Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

